summary: Trigger system panic when bpf is started
description: |+
    It tests if bpf info can be saved to the vmcore and be avaiable
    for later crash utilities analysis

contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - bcc
duration: 60m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/crash-bpf
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/crash-bpf
